// The STOCK theater - who LegendaryMissions fights, as data.
//
// This is the ladder that used to be two positional arrays in every map:
//
//     enemyTypeNameList = ["Kralien", "Torgoth", "Arvonian", "Ximni"]
//     diff_weight = [ [85,5,5,5], [82,6,6,6], ... [10,30,30,30] ]
//
// zipped together by position. Every row summed to 100, so they were already percentages -
// they just kept their race names somewhere else. Keyed, the names ARE the keys and nothing
// is positional, so a roster is no longer four long because a table happens to be four wide.
//
// WHAT THE LADDER MEANS. One race dominates at low difficulty and the mix DIVERSIFIES as it
// hardens: kralien hold 85% at difficulty 1 and 10% at 11. That the nominated race is
// kralien is an accident of it having been written first; here it is said outright, so a mod
// theater nominates whoever it likes by writing them at 85.
//
// SIX RACES, NOT FOUR. The old table was four columns wide, so the two NPC races it had no
// column for - skaraan and pirate - could not appear in it however much NPC_RACES said they
// were enabled. Skaraan were spawned by a separate hardcoded call in siege instead, and
// pirates not at all. The kralien share is preserved exactly at every tier and the remainder
// is split evenly, so the CURVE is unchanged and only the number of minors sharing it moves.
//
// EVERY MAP READS THIS ONE LADDER. What differs between the maps is not the weights but how
// many draws they make and what the drawn race has to be able to do:
//
//   siege                one draw per fleet
//   singlefront          one draw, the map's single attacker
//   doublefront          two draws, independent - the same race may come up twice
//   borderwar/deepstrike one draw, filtered to races that HAVE a starbase hull
//
// That filter is why borderwar and deepstrike used to list three races where the others list
// four: ximni have no starbase in shipData, and neither do pirates. It is derived now, so
// those two maps exclude exactly the races that cannot be built as a station - and skaraan,
// who can, stop being left out by hand.
//
// Selected by THEATER; with THEATER unset the maps fall back to this one by name.

# [Legendary](legendary)
---
Weights 1:  kralien:85, torgoth:3,    arvonian:3,    skaraan:3,    ximni:3,    pirate:3
Weights 2:  kralien:82, torgoth:3.6,  arvonian:3.6,  skaraan:3.6,  ximni:3.6,  pirate:3.6
Weights 3:  kralien:79, torgoth:4.2,  arvonian:4.2,  skaraan:4.2,  ximni:4.2,  pirate:4.2
